{"v":4,"catch":"1978年，我們迎戰了入侵者！","desc":"《SPACE INVADERS》是TAITO於1978年推出的射擊遊戲。\n這部曾風靡全日本的經典之作，終於登陸Arcade Archives！\n本作同時收錄黑白版與彩色版，並將音效還原至當年極致水準。\n再次體驗這部永恆傳奇！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-12-25","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/276cd365e262d6b4d54342882e16ec8fee9fa7ced7bea37ffdf273ee25a54254.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/297d42cfef770e0104218ab54aa70b6b8644062f6052fab03dfd0bbd7a4a7ce1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ee930a5f4e078eb902d0987c3a04a6ddf7c6e91a5ed50b4599c5a8e76ad5793.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eca52c92fb4c8edd0286fcb40f2f399f0a11a13ca04df59af5a4b051e24d521b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d90f209f7c5751b8894385cd03e2b4d1a1c58d3ec2fe450caf01ef7fc084310.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e0a372daa79ec6bab0bbb822ee118922793b760c0ee6294978f5614c8e30777d.jpg"],"titleId":"01007e2025a8a000","dlc":[]}